"lod) :ref:`🔗<shader_func_textureLod>`"
msgstr ""
"|gvec4_type| **textureLod**\\ (\\ |gsampler3D| s, vec3 p, float "
"lod) :ref:`🔗<shader_func_textureLod>`"

