"lod) :ref:`🔗<shader_func_texelFetch>`"
msgstr ""
"|gvec4_type| **texelFetch**\\ (\\ |gsampler2D| s, ivec2 p, int "
"lod) :ref:`🔗<shader_func_texelFetch>`"

