"component of the vector is obtained from the 16 least-significant bits of "
"``v``; the second component is obtained from the 16 most-significant bits of "
"``v``."
msgstr ""
"将一个 32 位整数解包为两个 16 位浮点数值，将它们转换为 32 位浮点数值，并将它"
